{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Mission:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab the delivery order from your car.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confirm the drop-off location.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the delivery as instructed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to your car and escape.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Simple, right?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if things go wrong\u2026 well, you\u2019re on your own. Good luck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Food Delivery Hero!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being rejected by major companies despite your prestigious university degree, you\u2019ve lost all hope and decided to become a food delivery rider. However, the delivery app you downloaded seems\u2026 glitchy. It keeps sending you to eerie locations\u2014crumbling old neighborhoods, deserted skyscrapers, and abandoned hospitals...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no worries! As a dedicated Food Delivery Hero, ghosts, hauntings, and even supernatural fights are no match for you. Your only goal is to deliver the order to the customer\u2019s doorstep\u2014on time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Order Upgraded!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The delivery mission behind each door is full of unknowns and randomness! Earn money by completing deliveries and use it to level up your rider rank. But beware\u2014higher ranks mean more advanced (and far more dangerous) orders. Don\u2019t forget to buy accident and life insurance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A compact experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a concise narrative game, with an average playtime of <strong>around 30 minutes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Accidental Insurance","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3218900/823cfbc521d24678d9cff5c2332738f26399a894.jpg"},{"name":"Mirror&Shadow","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3218900/e78c69f9746e4551e7e97b49a67a0914c1d4a46a.jpg"},{"name":"Delivery King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3218900/3acb75afb741c5b0348a3bb94e68309187695a79.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3218900?t=1755233090","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3218900?t=1755233090","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218900/897bcab49fa7982fae604b1cf1f3b616a63fceda/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755233090","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218900/897bcab49fa7982fae604b1cf1f3b616a63fceda/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755233090","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Contains mild horror and occasional jump scares"},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Your Mission:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab the delivery order from your car.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Confirm the drop-off location.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete the delivery as instructed.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Return to your car and escape.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Simple, right?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But if things go wrong\u2026 well, you\u2019re on your own. Good luck.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Food Delivery Hero!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After being rejected by major companies despite your prestigious university degree, you\u2019ve lost all hope and decided to become a food delivery rider. However, the delivery app you downloaded seems\u2026 glitchy. It keeps sending you to eerie locations\u2014crumbling old neighborhoods, deserted skyscrapers, and abandoned hospitals...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But no worries! As a dedicated Food Delivery Hero, ghosts, hauntings, and even supernatural fights are no match for you. Your only goal is to deliver the order to the customer\u2019s doorstep\u2014on time!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Order Upgraded!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The delivery mission behind each door is full of unknowns and randomness! Earn money by completing deliveries and use it to level up your rider rank. But beware\u2014higher ranks mean more advanced (and far more dangerous) orders. Don\u2019t forget to buy accident and life insurance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A compact experience</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a concise narrative game, with an average playtime of <strong>around 30 minutes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["PHANTOM PIXEL"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3218900/55456e72a4d90c79cae632e0e624585ee4eebae8/header.jpg?t=1755233090","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3218900/1868010494/e87b52f02ce0be2ef8ac66005bf48f69a6445d7a/1753888788/dash_av1.mpd?t=1753889364","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3218900/1868010494/e87b52f02ce0be2ef8ac66005bf48f69a6445d7a/1753888788/dash_h264.mpd?t=1753889364","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3218900/1868010494/e87b52f02ce0be2ef8ac66005bf48f69a6445d7a/1753888788/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1753889364","id":257175800,"name":"Delivered on time","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257175800/7133a0e30694c67ed2421d2afb9f9cfc08d407da/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1753889364"}],"nam